        {
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports a Structured Weight-Management Routine:</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;KetoVera was made to work well with those who are trying to achieve good weight management objectives. The components included in KetoVera are a combination of botanical and nutritional supplements that are often found in other supplements for wellness. Instead of being a replacement for good habits, KetoVera can be used along with balanced diets, physical activities, proper hydration, and enough sleep.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Convenient Liquid Supplement Format:</b>&nbsp;Another advantage of using KetoVera is the liquid form in which the supplement is available. Some people might find it easier to use a product in liquid form as opposed to capsules and pills. It may also be easier for users to maintain a regular supplementation schedule because of the simplicity of the product format. Users should adhere to the dosing guidelines on the label and not exceed the recommended dosage.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Provides a Combination of Botanical Ingredients: </b>The KetoVera product combines various botanical components into one supplement, which may be convenient for customers who are looking for plant-based nutritional supplements. Ingredients in the product may vary from the current formulation and may include such components as Green Tea, Guarana, African Mango, Maca Root, and Gymnema Sylvestre. It is important to note that each component has specific features and scientific evidence; thus, the product should be considered based on the current formulation.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Includes Nutritional Compounds Associated With Metabolism: </b>The ingredients that can be found in KetoVera supplement include Chromium Picolinate and L-Carnitine. Chromium is known to have an important role in the normal metabolism of macronutrients, whereas L-Carnitine naturally helps transport particular fatty acids to provide energy. Therefore, these nutrients’ biological actions can be seen as the rationale for adding them to supplements. At the same time, their addition should not be considered a promise of losing weight.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>May Complement Energy-Focused Wellness Goals: </b>Some KetoVera formulations include Green Tea and Guarana, ingredients commonly found in energy-oriented dietary supplements. Guarana naturally contains caffeine, while Green Tea may also provide caffeine depending on the extract. These ingredients may fit into an active lifestyle for some adults, but caffeine sensitivity differs between individuals. Consumers should check the current label and consider caffeine from all dietary sources.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Helps Simplify Daily Supplementation:</b>&nbsp;For individuals who would rather have an uncomplicated routine in terms of maintaining their health, KetoVera offers one liquid supplement that contains many ingredients in one package. Such a product is likely to minimize the necessity of managing several different supplements that contain one ingredient each. However, users are advised to familiarize themselves with the full ingredient list, instructions, and other information about this product.</span><br></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
